{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"676","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. The Last Fight Between Human and AI"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"100 years have passed since the last victory of the man versus computer in Go. Technologies made a huge step forward and robots conquered the Earth! It's time for the final fight between human and robot that will decide the faith of the planet."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following game was chosen for the fights: initially there is a polynomial "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"P(x) = anxn + an - 1xn - 1 + ... + a1x + a0, "}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" with yet undefined coefficients and the integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". Players alternate their turns. At each turn, a player pick some index "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":", such that coefficient "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"aj"},{"kind":"text","text":" that stay near "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xj"},{"kind":"text","text":" is not determined yet and sets it to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" value (integer or real, positive or negative, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" is also allowed). Computer moves first. The human will be declared the winner if and only if the resulting polynomial will be divisible by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"Q(x) = x - k"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polynomial "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"P(x)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is said to be divisible by polynomial "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"Q(x)"},{"kind":"text","text":" if there exists a representation "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"P(x) = B(x)Q(x)"},{"kind":"text","text":", where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B(x)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is also some polynomial."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Some moves have been made already and now you wonder, is it true that human can guarantee the victory if he plays optimally?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100 000, |k| ≤ 10 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the size of the polynomial and the integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of the following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain character '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' if the coefficient near "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is yet undefined or the integer value "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":", if the coefficient is already known ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 10 000 ≤ ai ≤ 10 000"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Each of integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" (and even "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"an"},{"kind":"text","text":") may be equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please note, that it's not guaranteed that you are given the position of the game where it's computer's turn to move."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) if the human has winning strategy, or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 2\n-1\n?\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Yes\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 100\n-10000\n0\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 5\n?\n1\n?\n1\n?\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"No"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, computer set "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" on the first move, so if human can set coefficient "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0.5"},{"kind":"text","text":" and win."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample, all coefficients are already set and the resulting polynomial is divisible by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x - 100"},{"kind":"text","text":", so the human has won."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"676E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/676/problem/E"}